      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"(i) Act for, on behalf of and at the direction\nof the Mayor in the exercise of all functions, powers\nand duties which the Mayor may have pursuant to the\nNew York State Local Finance Law, as the same may from\ntime to time be amended, the New York State Financial\nEmergency Act for The City of New York, as the same\nmay from time to time be amended, the New York City\nLoan Guarantee Act of 1978, P. L. 95-339, as the\nsame may from time to time be amended, an Agreement\nto Guarantee by and among the United States of America,\nthe State of New York, the City of New York, the\nNew York State Financial Control Board and the Municipal\nAssistance Corporation for The City of New York a\nGuaranteed Bond Purchase Agreement by and among the\nCity of New York, certain City pension funds, certain\nState pension funds and the United States of America,\neach dated as of November 15, 1978, and any seasonal\nfinancing agreement of the City of New York, including,\nbut not limited to, full power to execute for, on behalf\nof, and at the direction of the Mayor, any document\npursuant to any such agreement and any agreement,\namendment to such agreement or other document pursuant\nto such laws. The exercise of functions, powers and\nduties for, on behalf of, and at the direction of the\nMayor pursuant to this delegationshall not require the\nconsent in writing of the Mayor or any other official\nof the City.\"",
